Vercel AI Elements — vendored components
=========================================

The .tsx files in this directory are the genuine Vercel AI Elements components, copied from the
upstream repository the way the AI Elements CLI installs them. The shadcn/ui primitives they import
are in ../ui/, and shadcn's `cn` helper is ../../lib/utils.ts.

